 "sentences": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "start": 0.15,
   "speechStart": 0.15,
   "end": 2.9,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "A chart is a picture written in code."
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start": 3.15,
   "speechStart": 3.15,
   "end": 5.125,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Today we learn the code."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 5.375,
   "speechStart": 5.375,
   "end": 14.275,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "The key to all of it is a booklet called Chart Number One, which explains every symbol and abbreviation, and the exam draws straight from it."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 14.525,
   "speechStart": 14.525,
   "end": 18.45,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Start with color, because color tells you the most at a glance."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 18.7,
   "speechStart": 18.7,
   "end": 20.75,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "Buff or tan is land."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 21.0,
   "speechStart": 21.0,
   "end": 28.575,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "Green marks areas that cover and uncover with the tide: mud flats and oyster bars that are dry at low water."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 28.825,
   "speechStart": 28.825,
   "end": 30.825,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "Blue is shallower water."
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 31.075,
   "speechStart": 31.075,
   "end": 33.125,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "White is deeper water."
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 33.375,
   "speechStart": 33.375,
   "end": 35.775,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "That one feels backward, doesn’t it?"
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 36.025,
   "speechStart": 36.025,
   "end": 39.1,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "On a chart, the blue is where you run aground."
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 39.35,
   "speechStart": 39.35,
   "end": 46.775,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "And magenta, that purplish red, is used for lights, aids to navigation, cables, and restricted areas."
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 47.025,
   "speechStart": 47.025,
   "end": 48.725,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Why magenta?"
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start": 48.975,
   "speechStart": 49.725,
   "end": 53.3,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "It stands out, even under a red night-light at the helm."
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "start": 53.55,
   "speechStart": 53.55,
   "end": 56.15,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "When you see it, something there matters."
  }
 ]
}
